docs {
  # Create Mitra Kerja Riset
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `POST /api/mitra-kerja-riset`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Role Required:** Admin
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request Body)
  
  ```typescript
  interface CreateMitraDTO {
    nama: string;      // Required
    alamat?: string;
    kota?: string;
    negara?: string;
    kontak?: string;
    email?: string;
  }
  ```
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Validation |
  |-------|------|----------|------------|
  | nama | string | ✅ | - |
  | alamat | string | ❌ | - |
  | kota | string | ❌ | - |
  | negara | string | ❌ | - |
  | kontak | string | ❌ | - |
  | email | string | ❌ | Valid email |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (201 Created)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil membuat mitra kerja riset",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 400 | Nama wajib diisi |
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
  | 403 | Akses ditolak |
}
